$04 constant note_alarm      \ Notes: alarm (142)
$05 constant note_brk        \ Notes: sys: brk, a BRK instruction (133)
$10 constant note_user       \ Notes: 16-31 are the programs' own (128 + the note)
$80 constant note_group      \ NOTE's .A: a note group, not a task
$01 constant sem_mutex       \ SEM_NEW's .X: a mutex (its count 1, given back only by its holder)
$01 constant reboot_hwtest   \ REBOOT's .A: into the hardware test
$10 constant sem_max         \ Semaphores: as many as there can be at once
