$95 constant key_f12         \
$97 constant key_focus       \ Keys: the focus moved to another window of this one's group; its number is the
$96 constant key_resize      \ Keys: the window's size changed (a raw read's, keys hydra's: consctl reads with
$98 constant key_mod         \ Keys: a key the terminal sent modified (keys mods's): the modifiers next (1 Shi
